se,"text":"太壱のクラスの担任で、魔女。ニックネームはアヴィ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理科の先生……だが、自然科学やオカルト方面の授業に脱線する事が多く、よく教頭先生に怒られている。その溢れ出る色気と魔力でかなりモテるのだが、極度の年下好きという性癖の為に、全く彼氏が出来ないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の男子（特に太壱）を性的な目で見ている為、危険人物扱いされている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20366","sourceWorkId":"26624","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"太壱のクラスの担任で、魔女。ニックネームはアヴィ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理科の先生……だが、自然科学やオカルト方面の授業に脱線する事が多く、よく教頭先生に怒られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その溢れ出る色気と魔力でかなりモテるのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極度の年下好きという性癖の為に、全く彼氏が出来ないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の男子（特に太壱）を性的な目で見ている為、危険人物扱いされている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63436"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7c685636cead3d090bb5b38d62364ce2e7649902acd7f2fd3891885df0d9d3a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c82d6d57c87786fded4d3be111bb7b86d8089f108adac4e14d2d582984d76458.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:241844:63436:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91974","characterName":"蒼江 舞凍","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63433","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"241844"},{"characterId":"63433","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"310158"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20365"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91974"},"originalCharacterName":"蒼江 舞凍","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"37"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"101"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"J"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"93"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kuon's mother, and a Yuki-onna."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mai is so youthful that it's hard to believe she's a married woman with a child. She is one of the four chairmen of the IDF (International Federation of Humane Societies), and is the acting head of the Aoe family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mai became acquainted with Taichi through the incident with the magical element. She was trying to trick Kuon become Taichi's daughter-in-law, but Kuon and the others fell into a coma. And in order to wake her up, she needs the \"All-Purpose Holic Milk\" that can be squeezed by pouring magic into a demi-wife. The fact that she is a candidate for this position makes her aggressively approach the protagonist."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91974"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"紅音の母親。雪女。ある程度年齢はいっているが、亜人としての特性か二十歳そこそこに見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見、淑女に見えるが、かなりのエッチ好き。夫は吸血鬼の真祖だが、今は一年の大半を休眠している為、結構もてあましている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20365","sourceWorkId":"26624","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今作のヒロインの一人。紅音の母親で雪女。子持ちの人妻とは思えない程、若々しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ＩＤＦ（国際亜人連盟）の四大議長の一人で、蒼江家当主代行。魔素の件を切っ掛けに太壱とは知り合った。紅音を太壱の嫁にさせようと、娘アピールを行っていたが、紅音達が昏睡し、その覚醒の為に、高位魔力を持つデミ人妻に魔素を注ぐ事によって搾る事が出来る『万能の聖乳』が必要になった時、その候補者となった事から積極的にエッチなアプローチを掛けてくるようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20365","sourceWorkId":"29791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"紅音の母親。雪女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある程度年齢はいっているが、亜人としての特性か二十歳そこそこに見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見、淑女に見えるが、かなりのエッチ好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は吸血鬼の真祖だが、今は一年の大半を休眠している為、結構もてあましている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63433"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42140c98541208bda21f92dd61333f04bdc18863214e61173b94da28a7e9a586.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e43881d09151397d2e71d89b99d59b768d5db5da51f99921416a1984ebe4b0e6.webp","width":116,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:241844:63433:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:77225","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91975","characterName":"鬼上 夜叉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"85357","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"310158"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22893"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91975"},"originalCharacterName":"鬼上 夜叉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"37"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"99"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"H"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"96"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suzuka's mother and an Oni. Yasha is the general manager of the Kijou Group, which mainly runs a tourism business, and the mistress of the Kijou Hot Springs Inn. When she's not serving as a landlady, she has a bubbly, dynamic, and unassuming personality, but when she's serving as a mother, she shows her deep affection."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yasha has been a rival of Mai-Queen's since her school days, and they fight over every little thing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She dotes on Taichi as her future son, and her feelings for him exploded when he became a candidate in the Sacred Milk case. She will spoil him to excess."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c91975"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今作のヒロインの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鈴鹿の母親で鬼。観光業を中心に経営している鬼上グループの総帥であり鬼上温泉旅館の女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女将業の時以外は、気風が良く、豪快でサバサバした性格だが、母親としての顔の時は深い愛情をみせる。学生時代から舞凍とはライバルで、事ある毎にいがみ合っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"太壱の事は将来の息子として溺愛しており、聖乳の一件でも候補者となった事でその想いが爆発。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行き過ぎた甘やかしを行ってくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22893","sourceWorkId":"29791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今作のヒロインの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鈴鹿の母親で鬼。観光業を中心に経営している鬼上グループの総帥であり鬼上温泉旅館の女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女将業の時以外は、気風が良く、豪快でサバサバした性格だが、母親としての顔の時は深い愛情をみせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代から舞凍とはライバルで、事ある毎にいがみ合っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"太壱の事は将来の息子として溺愛しており、聖乳の一件でも候補者となった事でその想いが爆発。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行き過ぎた甘やかしを行ってくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"85357"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1b18caeb32082ecdd8280575f85adc9638334f7241d7fe16dc46b9ffa34208f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de272a6f0b502cebc2ce8bcaa140a4ef5cc08b92c6649c405a93da7dcddd65f9.webp","width":167,"height":256,"source":"static-