一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セイラの母親。日本生まれ、日本育ちだが、ルーツがインドの八大竜王にある為か、先祖返りで日本離れしたエキゾチックな見た目をしている。気性の激しい人竜族の中にあって、やや控えめな性格をしている。一族の掟で生まれた頃から、許嫁が決まっていて、適齢期になると同時に本人の意思とは関係なく結婚し、セイラをもうけた為、性的な事は無知に近い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"抑圧されてきた人生の為か、内心燃え上がるような恋や禁断の恋に異常なあこがれを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖乳候補に選ばれた事で、その秘めた想いを太壱にぶつけてくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22894","sourceWorkId":"29791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今作のヒロインの一人。セイラの母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本生まれ、日本育ちだが、ルーツがインドの八大竜王にある為か、先祖返りで日本離れしたエキゾチックな見た目をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気性の激しい人竜族の中にあって、やや控えめな性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一族の掟で生まれた頃から、許嫁が決まっていて、適齢期になると同時に本人の意思とは関係なく結婚し、セイラをもうけた為、性的な事は無知に近い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"抑圧されてきた人生の為か、内心燃え上がるような恋や禁断の恋に異常なあこがれを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖乳候補に選ばれた事で、その秘めた想いを太壱にぶつけてくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"85358"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c0b48e8251b026d14870123b0ad5b65443d7943d8c180edf093efce920d2a45.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4b68d4e41ccd5b8cc259de7aef61e4384cfa0067b14fb94b233b47e3997cc70.webp","width":167,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ひまり","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:77226","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69591","characterName":"天野 太壱","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69591"},"originalCharacterName":"天野 太壱","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third year in high school and the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is one of the unpopular group in his class who make a lot of ruckus."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He loves demihuman girls - in short, demi-girls, and has confessed to many demi-girls during the third years in the school but was turned down every time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of an accidental kiss with Kuon, the two of them bled just a little and he drank their mixed blood. As a result his semen has turned into a legendary elixir, the \"Awakening Essence\", and countless of demi-girls have started aiming for his chastity."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69591"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c69596","characterName":"グラァネ・グール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c69596"},"originalCharacterName":"グラァネ・グール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"They're ghoulas serving Aoe household and a true ancestor's familiars."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on their looks they are still in their teens, but they were serving the family before Mai even married into it so they're thought to be really old."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Both are poor at expressing their emotions and are together at all times."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Grani is the older sister and Grimo is the younger sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c69596"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afeb99faf127f3c54c54f33cd05878e5a7c3948d029ca63fc629d54a9d34070b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcd8124e9342479812d06d3d3d2eb7ca9bfd4a316f022594baf43a38589c9ea0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榛名 れん